d":"openai-math","schema":"statement-map-web/2","section":7,"section_title":"Martingale representation and optimization consequences","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:70b47dc54ae4982e4bb43dc564d32994044dea544d1870c185ed86fc2e0ffa83","file":"preprints/Full-support-of-the-zero-temperature-Sherrington-Kirkpatrick-order-parameter-September-27-2026/build/consequences.tex","line":14,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"9026188cf94baccf3429d3f39cb15ba7948c1c2c811313347c64edfe2b358167","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Full-support-of-the-zero-temperature-Sherrington-Kirkpatrick-order-parameter-September-27-2026/build/consequences.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:70b47dc54ae4982e4bb43dc564d32994044dea544d1870c185ed86fc2e0ffa83","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Full-support-of-the-zero-temperature-Sherrington-Kirkpatrick-order-parameter-September-27-2026/build/consequences.tex#L14"},"statement_kind":"corollary","text":"\\label{cor:value}\nLet $\\gamma$ be a minimizer, let $X$ be its diffusion, and write\n$u=\\Phi_{\\gamma,x}$ and $a=\\Phi_{\\gamma,xx}$. There is a bounded\nmartingale terminal value $U_1$ such that $u(t,X_t)\\to U_1$ almost surely\nand in $L^2$ as $t\\uparrow1$, with $U_1^2=1$ almost surely. Moreover,\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:value-identities}\n \\begin{aligned}\n P_*&=\\E|X_1|-\\int_0^1t\\gamma(t)\\,\\dd t\\\\\n    &=\\E[U_1 B_1]\n     =\\int_0^1\\E a(t,X_t)\\,\\dd t.\n \\end{aligned}\n\\end{equation}\nThe last integral is finite."}
